
### Create a post (login first)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Blog Post",
  "content": "This is my first post using the Express and PostgreSQL blog API."
}

### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts?page=1&limit=10

### Get a single post
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/1



### Update your post
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Blog Post",
  "content": "I updated my first blog post."
}

### Delete your post
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/posts/2


### Create a comment
POST http://localhost:5000/api/comments/post/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Great post! Thanks for sharing."
}

### Get comments for a post
GET http://localhost:5000/api/comments/post/3

### Update a comment
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Really helpful post!"
}

### Delete a comment
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/comments/2



### Like a post
POST http://localhost:5000/api/likes/post/3

### View likes
GET http://localhost:5000/api/likes/post/3

### Unlike a post
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/likes/post/3

### View likes again
GET http://localhost:5000/api/likes/post/3


### Successful request
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts

### Not found
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/999999


